        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-685.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-685-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH686-DMA-COHERENT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH687-ZERO-COPY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH688-DMA-LAT-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH689-690M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH690-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-685-WIT      PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-685.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-BEYOND-685.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH686-DMA-COHERENT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH687-ZERO-COPY-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH688-DMA-LAT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH689-690M-SAAT-OK = 1 AND
